# Optional. Only needed if you switch the imagery/DEM source to Mapbox.
# Free-tier token from https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/
# Leave unset to use the tokenless defaults (Esri World Imagery + USGS 3DEP).
#
# Vite only exposes vars prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle.
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
